{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":343,"skin":"露营","skin_jp":"キャンプ","skin_cn":"露营","skin_zh_tw":"露營","skin_list":[{"id":182,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":343,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/Student_Portrait_CH0235_Collection.png","skin":"露营","skin_cn":"露营"},{"id":509,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E7%9D%A1%E8%A1%A3/maki.png","skin":"睡衣","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"小涂","given_name":"真纪","family_name_jp":"小塗","given_name_jp":"マキ","family_name_kr":"코누리","given_name_kr":"마키","family_name_en":"Konuri","given_name_en":"Maki","family_name_zh_tw":"小塗","given_name_zh_tw":"真紀","family_name_cn":"小涂","given_name_cn":"真纪","nick_name":"兄弟","momo_talk_signature":"没有网真糟糕！","main_relation":36,"relation":[40],"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":149,"birthday":"08-01","hobby":"画图、玩游戏","designer":"9ml","illustrator":"CHILD","character_voice":"三上枝织","character_voice_cn":"金娜","release_date":"2025-02-12","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-07-22","school":4,"weapon_type":"MG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[651,914,912],"model":[104,323],"voice":[{"description":"CH0235_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案……。","text_original":"ブルーアーカイブぅ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/CH0235_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"今天真不想出门啊……。","text_original":"今日は外に出たくないなぁ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"啊，脑子里浮现出超棒的灵感了！","text_original":"あ、最高のインスピレーションが浮かんだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"要不要试试，之前从千寻前辈那里借来的简易床呢？","text_original":"前、チヒロ先輩に借りた簡易ベッド、\\n使ってみようかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"什么这是？这个名字怪怪的WI-FI……。","text_original":"なに？この変な名前のWi-Fi……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（在这上面能安装BOOM吗？……试试看吧！）","text_original":"（ここにBOOM、インストールできるかな？……やってみよ！）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"见识一下我的艺术吧！","text_original":"あたしの芸術を見てってよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_1_1","category":"event","text":"呜……竟然看不了年末特辑……。","text_original":"うぅ……年末特番を見れないなんて……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_1_2","category":"event","text":"千寻前辈太过分了！","text_original":"チヒロ先輩ひどい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"那片云……看上去有点像服务器主机呢。","text_original":"あの雲……サーバーコンピューターに似てるかも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"呜…好想敲键盘～这也太闲了～！","text_original":"うぅ、キーボード打ちたい～暇すぎるよぉ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"老师啊，你带什么能拿在手里玩的东西了吗？橡皮筋也行！","text_original":"ねぇ先生、なにか手を使うおもちゃとか持ってない？輪ゴムでもいいから！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"老师好像还挺享受露营的呢。","text_original":"先生は楽しんでるみたいだね、キャンプ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"那，我也稍微试着享受一下吧！","text_original":"じゃあ、あたしもちょっとは楽しんでみよっかな！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"好闲啊……要是有带着便携游戏机就好了……。","text_original":"暇だなぁ……携帯ゲーム機でも持ってくれば良かった……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"想要感受一下电磁波……。","text_original":"電磁波を感じてみたいかも……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"在大自然的画布上画点什么好呢。","text_original":"自然のキャンバスに何か描いてみようかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_season_2_1","category":"event","text":"（啊，壁画……忘了去掉了）","text_original":"（あ、壁画……消すの忘れてた）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_season_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_season_2_2","category":"event","text":"（算了，反正也不会有什么事吧？）","text_original":"（ま、別に何も起こらないよね？）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_season_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_season_end_1","category":"event","text":"好像也没有我想象的那么坏？晚饭吃的水炊鸡还挺好吃的来着……","text_original":"思ってたよりは悪くなかったかも？夕飯の水炊きは美味しかったし……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_season_end_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_season_end_2","category":"event","text":"能带上手机的话，应该还想再来呢。","text_original":"スマホ持ってきていいなら、また来たいかも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_season_end_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_eventlogin_season_end_3","category":"event","text":"才，才不是喜欢上露营了呢！","text_original":"べ、別にキャンプが好きになったわけじゃないよ…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_eventlogin_season_end_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"哪里有信号？……连上了！……欸，等一……唔啊啊！？","text_original":"電波どこ？……あった！……え、ちょっ……わあっ！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"连上吧，连上吧……成了！唔，呜啊啊！？","text_original":"繋がれ、繋がれ……よし！う、うわあっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"求你了，连上吧……哇！欸，欸欸……！？","text_original":"お願い、繋がって……わぁ！え、ええ……！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"唔哇，闯祸了……！算了，就这样吧……。","text_original":"うわっ、ミスった……！ま、いっか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"唔唔……额……刚才的你看到了？","text_original":"うぐぐ……ゲッ……今の見た？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"呜呀啊！？成，成功着陆……！","text_original":"うぎゃぁはっ！？ちゃ、着地成功……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"虽说这挺机枪改造得挺好看的……但是对于登山来说就有点太重了呢……也该轻量化改造一下了。","text_original":"このマシンガン、イイ感じに改造したけど……登山にはちょっと重すぎるんだよね……そろそろ軽量化しなきゃ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"唔诶……露营……。明明是休息日还要出门吗……？","text_original":"うぇ……キャンプ……。お休みの日なのに出かけるの……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"差不多也快要习惯露营了……这算是好事吗？","text_original":"キャンプにも慣れてきた気はするけど…………これっていい事なのかなぁ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"虽然路还很长，不过感觉已经明白该往哪走了！","text_original":"まだ道は遠いけど、どこに向かえばいいのか分かった気がする！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"嗯，这样应该就能再多努力一下了！","text_original":"うん、これならもっと頑張れそう！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"哦哦，灵感涌出来了！","text_original":"おお、インスピレーションが湧いてきた！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"虽然涂鸦的时候经常会爬很高的楼，不过爬山又是另外一种感觉呢。","text_original":"グラフィティをする時もよく高いビルに登ったけど、登山とはまた違う感じなんだよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"果然没有Wi-Fi整个人就没劲了啊……","text_original":"やっぱWi-Fiがないとエネルギーが切れちゃうというか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"如果不光是在秋天，其他季节也能看到红叶的话，山上的景色也会更加鲜艳吧……","text_original":"秋だけじゃなくて、他の季節にも紅葉が残ってたら山の景色も鮮やかなのになぁ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过……正因为红叶存在的时间短暂，才有着其独特的价值吧？","text_original":"まぁでも……紅葉は長く続かないからこそ価値があるんだよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"你说这对麻花辫？嗯，是我自己扎的。","text_original":"この三つ編み？うん、あたしが編んだんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为团子头扎起来有点费时间所以休息日里不想弄啊……","text_original":"お団子ってちょっと時間かかっちゃうから休みの日にはやりたくないんだよね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"千寻前辈，是怎么做到一大早就过来的？","text_original":"チヒロ先輩って、なんであんなに朝早く来れるんだろう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"难不成……她12点之前就睡觉了！？","text_original":"まさか……0時前に寝てるとか！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"涂鸦时用的材料，除了喷漆之外还有很多呢。就像之前我在洞窟里画的壁画那样！","text_original":"グラフィティの材料はね、ペンキ以外にも色々あるんだ。この前、あたしが洞窟で壁画を描いたようにね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"喷漆清除起来也挺费劲的……之后再找找可回收的天然材料吧。","text_original":"ペンキは消すのも大変だし……これからはリサイクルできる天然の材料を探そうかなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师。早上好。欸……这就又要出门了吗……？","text_original":"あ、先生。おはよう。あれ……また出かけるの……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天真冷呢！为了暖和起来，我把办公室的电器的功率都拉高了哦！","text_original":"今日寒いね！あったかくなるよう、執務室の電子機器に負荷をかけておいたよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"唔，呜咕咕……。","text_original":"うっ、うぐぐ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"又在同一个地方死掉了……。","text_original":"また同じとこで死んじゃった……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"说起来平板操作起来好难啊……。","text_original":"というかパッドの操作ムズ……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"明明这之后就只剩下最终boss了……却老是在同一个地方失误呢……。","text_original":"あとはもうラスボスだけなんだけど……同じとこでミスっちゃうんだよね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"因为和平常不大一样所以难度变高了……所以就变成这样了呢。莫名就激起好胜心了呢。","text_original":"普段と違うから難易度上がってるし……だからなのかな。妙に競争心が湧いちゃって。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"也没有其他的娱乐了……反而感觉更能专心打游戏了。","text_original":"他に娯楽もないしさー……逆にゲームに集中しちゃうかんじ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"难道说这就是露营的精髓吗？","text_original":"もしかして、これがキャンプの醍醐味ってやつなのかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"欸！？已经这个点了！？怎么办啊……","text_original":"えっ！？もうこんな時間！？どうしよう……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"老师～就只玩一把……这真的就是最后一把了……所以稍微再等一小会！","text_original":"先生ぇ～あともう一回だけ……本当にこれで最後にするから……もうちょっとだけ待って！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"一直以来都非常感谢，老师。我说的是真心话哦！","text_original":"いつもありがとう、先生。これは本心だよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"爬山真的很费劲啊……不过有老师陪着的话，倒也行吧。","text_original":"山に登るのは大変だけど……でも、先生が一緒なら、まぁいいかな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"老师，要一起散个步吗？没，没什么别的意思哦！？……天气这不是也挺不错的嘛？","text_original":"先生、一緒に散歩でもどう？べ、別に他意はないよ！？……天気もいいし？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"（欸？好奇怪啊……明明刚才老师的脸，看上去亮闪闪的……）","text_original":"（あれ？おかしいな……さっき先生の顔、すごくキラキラして見えたのに……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"哇……已经到我的生日了吗。呵呵，生日礼物就不用了。毕竟老师一直都很照顾我嘛。","text_original":"わぁ……もうあたしの誕生日か。 ふふっ、プレゼントはいいよ。先生には、いつもお世話になってるからね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"哇，老师！生日快乐！作为庆祝，就在夏莱的外墙上画一个超大的老师的肖像画——","text_original":"わあ、先生！お誕生日おめでとう！お祝いとして、シャーレの外壁に先生の肖像画を大きく描いたんだけど――","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊哈哈，开玩笑的开玩笑的。要是有什么想要的东西就说一声吧，什么都行哦！","text_original":"あはは、冗談冗談。なにか欲しいものあったら言ってね、なんでもいいよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"呀吼！万圣节到了哦，老师。今天也很适合让艺术之魂熊熊燃烧呢！怎么样？老师也来一起燃烧一下吗？","text_original":"やっほ！ハロウィンだよ、先生。芸術魂を思いっきり燃やせる日でもあるんだ。どう？あたしと一緒に燃やしにいかない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新年快乐。今天傍晚有时间的话，就在光之海岸碰面吧！","text_original":"先生、明けましておめでとう。今日夕方、時間があえば光の海岸で会おうね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊……光之海岸是游戏里的地名啦！","text_original":"あ……えっと、光の海岸はゲームの地名だよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"圣诞快乐，老师！今天这么冷，就呆在屋里做一堆圣诞花环吧。把夏莱到处都挂满！","text_original":"メリークリスマス、先生！今日は寒いから部屋の中でクリスマスリースをたくさん作ろう。シャーレを覆っちゃうくらい、いっぱい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"真是的！明明光是出来露营就够让我手忙脚乱的了！？","text_original":"もー！キャンプだけで手一杯なんだけど！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"欸？不用我上吗？","text_original":"え？出かけないとなの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0235_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"あ、これいいね！このまま連れてってよ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B6%82%20%E7%9C%9F%E7%BA%AA/%E9%9C%B2%E8%90%A5/jp/ch0235_formation_select.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0235_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_ori